// what data were GA and HR trained on? GA is “trained on real multi-view scan videos”, so where do its FLAME parameters for the test audio come from?
Training data: GA is trained on the real subject’s multi-view scan, because its FLAME registration requires multi-view consistency, which HeyGen videos cannot provide. HR, however, is a monocular method, not requiring cross-view data: we train it on the 15 HeyGen views, tracking each view independently. 

