# Evaluation on real multi-view footage

**Setup.** Novel-view reconstruction of real NeRSemble speech sequences (9 subjects); no audio-driven generation is involved. We use the same train/test camera split as in our main setup: both methods are trained on the same training cameras and evaluated on the held-out frontal camera 037.

**Metrics.** PSNR, SSIM and LPIPS against the real frames of camera 037, averaged per subject; mean ± std and two-sided paired t-test across the 9 subjects.

